# Every text file lands LF in the repo AND in the working tree, on every platform. The
# harness's shell scripts, git hooks, and Claude Code hooks all execute under bash
# everywhere (Git Bash on Windows), and a CRLF checkout kills them at the shebang with no
# useful error. Pinned here so no clone's core.autocrlf can undo it; harness/doctor.py
# checks the working-tree half on every run.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The fork overlay patch must stay byte-exact against base 7534d23 — never translated.
*.patch -text

# SQLite measurement corpus: binary, never diffed, never translated.
*.db binary
